# CCTV SUMMARY — cam14_stream-14 (Unknown Location, cam14)
**Coverage:** 171 minutes of footage (minutes 0–170), Saturday 13-06-2026, approx. 21:24–22:38 per in-video timestamps (parts 2 and 4).

## 1. SCENE
The camera overlooks a busy urban road intersection at night, well lit by street lighting. The junction has zebra/pedestrian crossings, a side road, and background buildings including one bearing an illuminated "WESTBANK"/"West Bank" sign (minutes 41, 44, 84, 92, 111, 114, 121, 160, 165). Traffic lights are present (green noted at minutes 0 and 20; briefly red at minute 113). The road surface appeared wet with a reflective sheen, suggesting recent or ongoing rain, at intermittent points throughout: minutes 15, 21, 23, 29–32, 50–51, 58, 67, 77, 81, 84, 92, 96, 106, 109, 118, 120, 128, 133, 135, 138, 143, 144, 149, 155–157, 162, 164–166, 169. Weather was otherwise clear.

## 2. TRAFFIC AND PEOPLE
Traffic was steady and continuous throughout, light-to-moderate to busy, with no build-ups. Vehicle types observed:
- **White hatchback/car:** the dominant recurring vehicle, entering from the left and exiting right at roughly the 30-second mark in nearly every minute across all seven parts (e.g. minutes 2, 3, 5, 9–13, 15–17, 21, 23–24, 25, 27–29, 31, 33, 35–39, 41, 43, 45–49, 51, 55–57, 61–65, 67–71, 75, 76, 80–82, 84, 86, 89–91, 93, 95, 96, 99, 100, 102–105, 108–112, 114, 116–118, 120, 123–124, and most of 125–170).
- **Auto-rickshaws:** numerous, in white, yellow, yellow-green, green, black, red and blue (e.g. green at minutes 3, 27, 35, 134, 137, 140, 148, 156; red at 15, 39, 158; blue at 21, 90, 162; black at 143; yellow-green pairs at minutes 89 and 122). One white auto-rickshaw stopped near a pedestrian crossing before exiting left (minute 66); two people alighted from a white auto-rickshaw and walked to a crossing (minute 119).
- **Cars:** white sedans (minutes 0, 1, 9, 18, 30, 54, 58, 66, 115), black sedans/SUVs (minutes 0, 5, 6, 8, 10, 16, 37, 38, 42, 46, 59, 71, 75, 78, 82, 88, 93, 95–97, 108, 112, 114, 116, 123, 127, 129, 131, 132, 135, 136, 139, 142, 145, 148, 153, 156, 157, 159, 163), red cars/SUVs/sedans/pickup (minutes 20, 26, 31, 33, 47, 63, 93, 99, 103, 104, 106, 109, 121, 130, 131, 134, 137, 142, 145, 154, 158, 160, 162–164), a silver sedan (minutes 35, 93, 129, 169), a blue car (minute 147), an orange sedan (minute 55), and a silver hatchback turning right (minute 72).
- **Buses:** red buses (minutes 3–5 stationary, 23, 38, 48, 49, 56, 58, 65, 70, 76, 77, 91, 105, 107, 152, 161, 169), blue buses (minutes 28, 32, 54, 67, 128, 167), a "GSRTC"-branded bus (minute 36), a large orange bus (minute 59), and a stationary white bus near the West Bank sign (minutes 111, 114, 121). The minute-161 red bus was noted as model "Patel".
- **Vans/trucks:** silver van (minutes 7, 157), white van (minutes 61, 126, 140, 159, 168), a red van parked on the right with rear lights illuminated (minute 42), a white van marked "FS COURIERS & CARGO SERVICE" stationary near centre-right (minute 85), a blue truck with goods loaded and a person standing by it (minute 22), a blue pickup truck (minute 110), a blue municipal garbage truck in the foreground (minute 125), and a large blue vehicle, possibly a bus or van (minute 124).
- **Motorcycles/scooters:** present in nearly every minute, in white, black, red, green, yellow, blue, dark and light colours, riding in various directions or waiting at crossings; some carried two helmeted riders (minute 92). A red-and-black motorbike carrying two people stopped near centre-left (minute 74).

**People:** pedestrians appeared occasionally at the crosswalks — minute 1 (people at crosswalks), minute 8 (two crossing in front of the camera at ~45s), minute 14 (two on the crosswalk), minute 22 (person standing by a blue truck), minute 42 (person in dark jacket crossing in front of the red van), minute 60 (person in dark clothing walking toward centre; person in light shirt near a white vehicle; person crossing in front of a white car), minute 74 (person in white shirt on a zebra crossing), minutes 87, 90, 94 (pedestrians at zebra crossings, including a man in light pants and dark top at 12s of minute 94; a male rider in dark reflective clothing at 0s and a scooter rider at 36s), minute 98 (person in dark clothing standing centre-left), minute 100 (pedestrian on crosswalk), minute 101 (person in dark clothing bottom-left; rider in white shirt and helmet; auto-rickshaw rider), minute 119 (two people alighting from an auto-rickshaw), minute 122 (pedestrian on foot), minute 144 (two men, 30–40, dark hair, light brown skin, white shirts, black pants, one wearing a helmet), minute 149 (person in white shirt and dark pants turning right; motorcyclist in red jacket; person near a yellow auto-rickshaw), minute 170 (background pedestrian activity). No person-to-person interactions of note.

